</complex-values><complex-values><field id="images" type="multiComplex"><complex-values><field id="imageURL" type="input"><value>//sc04.alicdn.com/kf/H5f71c3cfb4064b51bb458d0a786cb402R/286385890/H5f71c3cfb4064b51bb458d0a786cb402R.jpg</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="gallery" type="singleCheck"><value displayName="Packaging &amp; shipping specifications">700</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="companyDesc" type="input"><value>Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear &amp; Apparel Co., Ltd. is based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. The company images introduce our general footwear development and order coordination capabilities. Model-specific samples, customization, packing and dispatch arrangements are reviewed against your requirements before quotation.</value></field><field id="textDesc" type="input"><value>Basketball-inspired casual sneaker styling with a mesh textile upper, lace-up closure, rear pull tab and rubber outsole. The source specifies a rubber + MD sole assembly; separate midsole and lining compositions are not specified. Choose six color combinations shown in the actual photos and listed size labels 36–45; confirm size measurements before ordering. Minimum order: 2 pairs. Send your quantities by color and size, destination and packing requirements for a quotation. Performance, availability and customization are confirmed for your selected order; no tested sporting or medical performance is claimed.</value></field><field id="companyFaqDesc"><complex-values><field id="question"><value>What materials are used?</value></field><field id="answers"><value>The upper is mesh textile and the outsole is rubber. The source specifies a rubber + MD sole assembly; separate midsole and lining compositions are not specified.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question"><value>How is the shoe fastened?</value></field><field id="answers"><value>The shoe has a lace-up closure and a rear pull tab. The images show the actual construction.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question"><value>Which sizes can I select?</value></field><field id="answers"><value>Listed size labels are 36–45. The sizing system is not specified; please confirm measurements and your quantities by size before ordering.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question"><value>What is the minimum order?</value></field><field id="answers"><value>The minimum order is 2 pairs. Please send the colors, sizes and quantities you need so we can confirm the order details.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question"><value>How are price and delivery confirmed?</value></field><field id="answers"><value>2–49 pairs: USD 13.43/pair; 50–99 pairs: USD 12.54/pair; 100+ pairs: USD 11.65/pair. Freight, packing and dispatch timing are confirmed for your order.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question"><value>Can I request samples or a packaging change?</value></field><field id="answers"><value>Please send your sample quantity and packaging requirements. Feasibility, price and timing will be confirmed for your request before an order is accepted.</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="pkgMeasure" type="complex"><complex-value><field id="length" type="input"><value>34</value></field><field id="width" type="input"><value>23</value></field><field id="height" type="input"><value>13</value></field></complex-value></field><field id="pkgWeight" type="input"><value>0.5</value></field></itemSchema>